      "value": "B-ALSC - BACnet Advanced Life Safety Controller"
    },
    "productDescription": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "A BACnet/IP advanced life safety controller built on the CAS BACnet Stack. A smoke detector (simulated - the example's only input from the physical world) is Life Safety Point 1; its zone is Life Safety Zone 1. The device latches the detector's alarm, sends CHANGE_OF_LIFE_SAFETY event notifications to the recipients in a writable recipient list, logs every notification in Event Log 1, and executes LifeSafetyOperation (silence / unsilence / reset), AcknowledgeAlarm and GetEventInformation. Schedule 1 drives Analog Output 1 by date and time from the device clock, which TimeSynchronization sets. It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-ALSC profile."
    },
    "productName": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-ALSC"
    },
